    "html":  "\u003cdiv class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cb\u003eGolden Hare of Dawn [初陽の黄金兎\u003c/b\u003e, Hatsu yō no kogane usagi\u003cb\u003e]\u003c/b\u003e\n\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan typeof=\"mw:File\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/3/38/Aurelia_qbub.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20230107032253\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"Aurelia qbub\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"400\" height=\"613\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Aurelia qbub.jpg\" data-image-key=\"Aurelia_qbub.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/3/38/Aurelia_qbub.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/400?cb=20230107032253\" /\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eA woman with an absolutely bewitching look and attitude. Her true identity is that of a monstrous rabbit, who has taken human form in order to find a strong partner for the prosperity of her descendants. She shines bright like the sunlight with her golden hair waving as she leaps and fight, using her bestial abilities.\n\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cdiv id=\"gallery-0\" hash=\"1a110af5a4c0851439f73c8024d35112\" data-seq-no=\"0\" class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:187px;\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"Aurelia_Queen-s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_-jpg\" style=\"position: relative; height:185px; width:76px;\"\u003e\u003ca class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/